        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "words": 32,
      "text": "The third [place wherein it is], is the First Man, h[e] wh[o ... ... ] armour. Again, it is this fire [ ... ... ] on the body of the Perfect Man.",
